ibility behavior and publish authoring guidance.\nscope:Shared vectors and fixtures, validator/test harness updates, legacy guards, authoring and operator docs, release metadata, claim-v3 qualification rules, and an integrated curator-spec verification outcome. Manager-specific implementation is out of scope.\nac:Vectors cover SHA-1/SHA-256, exact tagged and untagged resolution, moved/missing/malformed refs and objects, HTTPS/SSH identity, local substitutions, submodule/LFS/link/special-file/alternate/replace/graft/promisor/filter/helper negatives, whole-snapshot audit ordering, cache hit/miss/corruption, receipt-v2/marker-v3 mixed bytes, status/repair/GC, rollback, PATH/shim checks, and signing boundaries; claim v3 lists only evidenced platforms and drivers and excludes Linux until its later story passes; full clean validation, regeneration, compatibility, and release gates pass and exact downstream pins are recorded.\nblockedBy:[\"TASK-260728-17sclp\",\"TASK-260728-wy3dsw\"]\nblocks:[\"TASK-260728-pwbr32\"]\nderivedBlockedBy:[]\nderivedBlocks:[]\nchecklist:[{\"text\":\"Run clean regeneration plus the complete curator-spec validation suite\",\"done\":false},{\"text\":\"Attach rc.5 release evidence and exact downstream protocol pin\",\"done\":false}]\nnotes:\ncreated:2026-07-27T20:20:00Z\nupdated:2026-07-27T20:21:22Z\nisBlocked:true\nisAdvisoryBlocked:false\nchildren:[]\npreconditionResources:[]\noutcomeResources:[]\nid:STORY-260728-10wxx2\ntype:story\nname:protocol-schema-v7-external-build-repositories\ntitle:STORY-260728-10wxx2: protocol-schema-v7-external-build-repositories\nstatus:development\nreview:required\ntask_class:docs\nestimate:{\"kind\":\"estimated\",\"scale\":{\"kind\":\"fibonacci\",\"number\":29}}\nobservability:{\"readiness\":{\"advisoryBlockedElementIds\":[\"STORY-260728-10wxx2\"],\"blockedElementIds\":[\"TASK-260728-3b8qym\",\"TASK-260728-wy3dsw\"],\"coverage\":{\"complete\":true,\"estimated\":4,\"ratio\":\"4/4\",\"total\":4,\"unestimated\":0},\"estimateKind\":\"estimated\",\"isAdvisoryBlocked\":true,\"isBlocked\":true,\"rolledEstimate\":{\"kind\":\"estimated\",\"scale\":{\"kind\":\"fibonacci\",\"number\":29}}},\"scope\":{\"id\":\"STORY-260728-10wxx2\",\"name\":\"protocol-schema-v7-external-build-repositories\",\"type\":\"story\"},\"summary\":{\"active\":[{\"id\":\"STORY-260728-10wxx2\",\"name\":\"protocol-schema-v7-external-build-repositories\",\"status\":\"development\"},{\"id\":\"TASK-260728-17sclp\",\"name\":\"external-repository-wire-schemas-and-generated-cases\",\"status\":\"development\"}],\"blocked\":[{\"blockedBy\":[],\"derivedBlockedBy\":[\"STORY-260720-35dck7\"],\"id\":\"STORY-260728-10wxx2\",\"isAdvisoryBlocked\":true,\"isBlocked\":false,\"name\":\"protocol-schema-v7-external-build-repositories\"},{\"blockedBy\":[\"TASK-260728-17sclp\",\"TASK-260728-wy3dsw\"],\"derivedBlockedBy\":[],\"id\":\"TASK-260728-3b8qym\",\"isAdvisoryBlocked\":false,\"isBlocked\":true,\"name\":\"rc5-external-repository-conformance-and-release-gates\"},{\"blockedBy\":[\"TASK-260728-17sclp\"],\"derivedBlockedBy\":[],\"id\":\"TASK-260728-wy3dsw\",\"isAdvisoryBlocked\":false,\"isBlocked\":true,\"name\":\"external-repository-manager-profile-and-lifecycle-contract\"}],\"byType\":{\"bug\":{\"total\":0,\"todo\":0,\"active\":0,\"done\":0,\"closed\":0,\"blocked\":0},\"epic\":{\"total\":0,\"todo\":0,\"active\":0,\"done\":0,\"closed\":0,\"blocked\":0},\"story\":{\"total\":1,\"todo\":0,\"active\":1,\"done\":0,\"closed\":0,\"blocked\":0},\"task\":{\"total\":4,\"todo\":2,\"active\":1,\"done\":1,\"closed\":0,\"blocked\":0}}}}\nparent:EPIC-260720-21aq1i\nassignee:\ndescription:Extend curator-spec with the accepted schema-7/rc.5 contract for source-audited external Git repositories that produce manager-installed CLI commands. Preserve schemas 1-6 and go-v1 byte and semantic compatibility while adding build_repositories, immutable commit locks with optional exact-tag assertions, curator-build.json schema 1 logical targets, go-repository-v1, operator substitutions, receipt v2, marker v3, and claim v3.\nscope:curator-spec normative prose, JSON schemas, generated cases, conformance vectors, manager profile and CLI contract, authoring documentation, and rc.5 release evidence. No Curator or cocoaskills implementation. Normative architecture input is TASK-260720-1nvomm_external-build-repositories-architecture-v6.md at SHA-256 2abae77d80eba6789f9911db7e9722595b4f21ba47391ca9eafd0064af03d67e.\nac:Schema 7 and every new wire artifact are closed, versioned, and implementation-ready; external source is resolved, raw-snapshot validated, hashed, and independently audited before cache or compiler work; inaccessible sources follow typed offline-warning versus install/audit hard-failure semantics; package-controlled argv, environment, output paths, executable names, credentials, hooks, signing, and generic language drivers remain forbidden; schemas 1-6, go-v1, receipt v1, marker v1/v2, and rc.4 claims remain unchanged; generated cases, validators, compatibility guards, and rc.5 release gates pass.\nblockedBy:[]\nblocks:[]\nderivedBlockedBy:[\"STORY-260720-35dck7\"]\nderivedBlocks:[\"STORY-260728-1ojb1p\"]\nchecklist:[]\nnotes:\ncreated:2026-07-27T20:19:19Z\nupdated:2026-07-27T21:04:06Z\nisBlocked:false\nisAdvisoryBlocked:true\nchildren:[\"TASK-260728-17sclp\",\"TASK-260728-1a52au\",\"TASK-260728-3b8qym\",\"TASK-260728-wy3dsw\"]\npreconditionResources:[]\noutcomeResources:[]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
